OL,3,GNEWSAMan to stand trial for murder of
OL,4,Apolice station janitor 27 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is to stand trial accused of the
OL,7,Fmurder of a police station janitor in
OL,8,FGlasgow more than 27 years ago.
OL,10,FAllan Humphrey, 68, allegedly killed
OL,11,FMichael McManus on his way to work at
OL,12,FBaird Street station in Riddrie on 13
OL,13,FJuly 1999.
OL,15,FCourt papers state that Humphrey
OL,16,Fstabbed 46-year-old McManus on the body
OL,17,Fand leg with a knife or similar
OL,18,Finstrument.
OL,20,FHumphrey pleaded not guilty to the
OL,21,Fsingle charge of murder during a
OL,22,Fhearing at the High Court in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
